{"id":"n61607-4-7","stage":1,"title":"놀라다 · 受刺激","scene":"身体不适","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61607-4-7-1","ko":"배가 많이 아프니?","zh":"肚子很疼吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"배가","meaning":"腹部","explanation":"배：腹部；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"배","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20211","senseId":"2","lemma":"배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배가","audio":"/audio/c5a9b1ff55fc80e6120e.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"很、非常","explanation":"많이：表示程度高；这里问肚子是否很疼。","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"아프니?","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아프니","audio":"/audio/29e7649e047935bbb17d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3d0af87e12fd988a","term":"배","zh":"腹部","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3","entryId":"20211","definition":"人或动物的身体中消化食物的肠胃等内脏所在的部位。","pronunciation":["배"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"很、非常","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"表示数量或程度高；本句修饰“疼”。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼， 痛，不舒服","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"因受伤或生病，而感到痛症或痛苦。","pronunciation":["아프다"]}],"audio":"/audio/95fff17dacc506588155.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61607-4-7-2","ko":"응. 너무 매운 걸 먹어서 속이 좀 놀랐나 봐.","zh":"嗯。因为吃了太辣的东西，胃好像受刺激了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"매운","meaning":"辣","explanation":"맵다：辣；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"맵다","audio":"/audio/13d9c3d2d64fee08dc08.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74131","senseId":"1","lemma":"맵다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"매운","audio":"/audio/e008a63b3263410b6f35.mp3"}},{"text":"걸","meaning":"辣的东西","explanation":"걸 是 것을 的口语缩略；매운 걸 指“辣的东西、辣的食物”。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸","audio":"/audio/6cebaf71218a575e8966.mp3"}},{"text":"먹어서","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹어서","audio":"/audio/fde9845da352d414d301.mp3"}},{"text":"속이","meaning":"内脏，心口，肚子","explanation":"속：内脏，心口，肚子；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"속","audio":"/audio/27e1c3f6a82b5a8bcf92.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71278","senseId":"3","lemma":"속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"속이","audio":"/audio/6f6688764f24b1ca69ac.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"놀랐나","meaning":"受了刺激","explanation":"놀라다 本义是受惊；这里比喻胃受到辣食刺激而不适。-았- 表示过去，-나 봐 表示推测。","readings":[{"term":"놀라다","audio":"/audio/ca0d0655d175ea6cd75b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61607","senseId":"4","lemma":"놀라다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놀랐나","audio":"/audio/d64f09c950bda512e95b.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"13d9c3d2d64fee08","term":"맵다","zh":"辣","audio":"/audio/13d9c3d2d64fee08dc08.mp3","entryId":"74131","definition":"像辣椒或芥末等那样味道有刺激性，舌尖有刺痛感。","pronunciation":["맵따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"东西、食物","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"것 的口语形式；这里指前面的“辣的食物”。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"27e1c3f6a82b5a8b","term":"속","zh":"内脏，心口，肚子","audio":"/audio/27e1c3f6a82b5a8bcf92.mp3","entryId":"71278","definition":"人的身体中，腹部的内部或肠胃。","pronunciation":["속ː"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一点点，有一点","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"分量或程度稀少地。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"ca0d0655d175ea6c","term":"놀라다","zh":"受刺激","audio":"/audio/ca0d0655d175ea6cd75b.mp3","entryId":"61607","definition":"身体某部位受到刺激后出现明显反应；本句指胃因辛辣食物不适。","pronunciation":["놀ː라다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/010a42e91add6a23f5ff.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.22,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=61607","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"4","sourceLevel":"초급","day":36,"sequenceScore":1.5988,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯。因为吃了太辣的东西，胃好像受刺激了。","肚子很疼吗？","请问有没有看到原来放在这里的棕色皮夹？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["肚子很疼吗？","请问有没有看到原来放在这里的棕色皮夹？","嗯。因为吃了太辣的东西，胃好像受刺激了。"],"answer":2}]}
